(label "FB_VB_BUF" (at 160 246.35 270) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 8b1c5def-1b82-482b-b2bb-cad3897e0226))
(text "V-I BRIDGE (DUT LO grounded)\nNODE_A -> Rref (one relay closed) -> NODE_B = DUT HI.  Z = Rref * V_B / (V_A - V_B).\nBoth nodes are buffered by ADA4817 (FET input, 1 GHz) and measured simultaneously -> ratiometric,\nsource amplitude/phase drift cancels. Open/short/load compensation removes relay and fixture parasitics.\nRanges: 10 / 100 / 1k / 10k / 100k (0.1%). Use only 10 and 100 ohm above ~5 MHz." (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7f8f0c9e-f623-4026-8297-346d0d7afc6c))
(text "Buffers: unity gain, FB pin tied to -IN; a 0 ohm link from OUT to FB allows a series isolation\nresistor to be fitted later if the long run to the mixers rings." (at 180 200 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid eed95ccc-62bb-4226-b394-d2354fb92d1b))
)
